<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Atria started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Atria started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hilliard Lyons analyst Stephen O'Neil said he started coverage of Atria Communities Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the developer of assisted living communities for the elderly were off 1/2 to 12-1/4.</p>
<p>--O'Neil said he sees no earnings per share growth in 1996 or 1997 but a sharp upturn in 1997 and 1998 and recommends buying before the market drives up the stock price.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
